<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Rishil Agarwal - Creative Resume</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #e8e8e8;
            --highlight-yellow: #fdf100;
            --accent-green: #39ff14;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #121212;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 50px 0;
            color: #333;
        }

        .page {
            width: 850px;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: radial-gradient(#bcbcbc 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Header ID Card */
        .header-card {
            display: flex;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .profile-pic {
            width: 150px;
            height: 180px;
            background: #444;
            margin-right: 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .header-text h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .contact-info {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        /* Section Titles */
        .section-title {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--highlight-yellow);
            padding: 5px 20px;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            border-radius: 50% 10% 40% 5%;
            transform: rotate(-1deg);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .left-col { flex: 1.5; }
        .right-col { flex: 1; }

        /* Project & Education Items */
        .item {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 2px dashed #999;
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        .item h3 { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .item p { margin: 2px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.4; }

        /* Stickers Wall */
        .sticker-wall {
            position: relative;
            height: 200px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .sticker {
            position: absolute;
            padding: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .s-python { background: #f4a261; transform: rotate(8deg); top: 10px; left: 10px; }
        .s-cpp { background: #e76f51; color: white; transform: rotate(-5deg); top: 50px; left: 100px; }
        .s-sql { background: #8ecae6; transform: rotate(12deg); top: 20px; right: 20px; }
        .s-oop { background: #accent-green; transform: rotate(-10deg); top: 90px; right: 50px; }

        /* Skill Bars */
        .skill-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .bar {
            width: 100%; height: 8px;
            background: #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .fill { height: 100%; background: #222; border-radius: 4px; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="page">
        <header class="header-card">
            <div class="profile-pic">PHOTO</div>
            <div class="header-text">
                <h1>RISHIL AGARWAL</h1>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0; font-style: italic;">Computer Science & Engineering Student</p>
                <div class="contact-info">
                    rishilagarwal49@gmail.com | +91 8239949323 <br>
                    Aburoad, India | Sem 4 CGPA: 8.26/10
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="left-col">
                <h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
                
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Tic-Tac-Toe with AI</h3>
                    <p>Implemented Minimax algorithm in C++ for optimal AI decision-making in a console-based environment.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Car Dealership Management</h3>
                    <p>C++ based system using OOP principles to manage inventory, sales tracking, and customer handling.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Unit Converter CLI</h3>
                    <p>CLI tool handling 15+ units across length, weight, and temperature with robust input validation.</p>
                </div>

                <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>MIT World Peace University</h3>
                    <p>Bachelor of Technology in CSE (2023 – 2027)</p>
                    <p><strong>CGPA: 8.26/10</strong> (As of Semester 4)</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="right-col">
                <h2 class="section-title">Core Skills</h2>
                <div class="sticker-wall">
                    <div class="sticker s-python">PYTHON</div>
                    <div class="sticker s-cpp">C++ / C</div>
                    <div class="sticker s-sql">SQL</div>
                    <div class="sticker s-oop">OOP / DSA</div>
                </div>

                <h2 class="section-title">Competencies</h2>
                <div class="skill-grid">
                    <div>
                        <small>DBMS</small>
                        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width: 85%;"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <small>Networks</small>
                        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width: 75%;"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <small>Team Mgmt</small>
                        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width: 90%;"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <small>English</small>
                        <div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width: 95%;"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Interests</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                    • AI/ML Research (NLP, BERT)<br>
                    • Web Development<br>
                    • Event Organizing
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
